No artificial glowing skin.
No random facial hair.
No hairstyle replacement.
No sunglasses.
No hat.
No jewelry unless identity-relevant.
No suit.
No jacket.
No tie.
No colorful clothing.
No logos.
No text.
No watermark.
No signature.
No environmental background.
No props.
No excessive lens flare.
No extreme blue color cast over the entire skin.
No crushed facial shadows.
No overexposed highlights.
No CGI.
No 3D.
No illustration.

FINAL RESULT:

A striking photorealistic vertical studio portrait of the exact uploaded person, photographed directly from the front against a perfectly clean saturated cobalt-blue background. The subject wears a minimalist black ribbed Henley shirt and looks calmly and directly into the camera. Dramatic controlled split lighting creates a brighter natural side of the face and a darker cinematic side accented by subtle cool blue illumination. The composition is centered, minimal and symmetrical, while the person's real facial identity, hairstyle, skin texture, age and distinctive characteristics remain faithfully preserved. Premium professional editorial portrait photography with extremely realistic facial detail and no visible AI aesthetic.